{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊本無此則下二句，今依悅庵所科之本附見于此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因學人問照者下八\n句，遂而評之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓融照者方乃照之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "著字而說，不可窮也。此以實證而斥虛說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如上照者合自在說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "只能照者便成暗證，此以雙美斥於獨善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自在說者方乃說之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滯情而照，不可窮也。此以雙美而斥暗證"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如上說者合圓融照"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但能說者必成謗法，復以雙輪而斥雙翼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《涅槃》云：十住能少分見法身，見\n不了了。天台判為圓位。妙樂云：唯《華嚴》、《起信》明初住八相最為顯著"}
